        <div class="th cols-16-1-14"><span>Event / obligation</span><span>Statement(s) affected</span><span>Notes</span></div>
        <div class="tr cols-16-1-14"><span>§264(2) true-and-fair shortfall</span><span><span class="badge be">Anhang</span></span><span>Additional disclosure, no change to Bilanz/GuV figures</span></div>
        <div class="tr alt cols-16-1-14"><span>§264(3) subsidiary exemption</span><span>—</span><span>Entire individual Jahresabschluss/Lagebericht obligation falls away</span></div>
        <div class="tr cols-16-1-14"><span>§265(3) item combination</span><span><span class="badge bs">Bilanz</span> <span class="badge be">Anhang</span></span><span>Face-of-statement simplification, detail preserved in the notes</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============ SECTION 26 ============ -->
  <div class="section-header" id="s26"><span class="num">26</span><h2>Related Provisions — Cross-Reference Map</h2><span class="line"></span></div>
