  <!-- ============ SECTION 27 ============ -->
  <div class="section-header" id="s27"><span class="num">27</span><h2>Quick-Reference Glossary</h2><span class="line"></span></div>
  <div class="three-col">
    <div class="card cn">
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Kapitalmarktorientiert</div><div class="glossary-def">Capital-market-oriented — a corporation whose securities are admitted to, or have applied for admission to, trading on an organised market (§264d).</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Komplementär</div><div class="glossary-def">The general partner in a KG, normally bearing unlimited personal liability — unless itself a limited-liability entity, triggering §264a.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card cn">
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Gliederungsschema</div><div class="glossary-def">The prescribed line-item structure the Bilanz and GuV must follow, and which §265 requires to be generally retained from year to year.</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Ein den tatsächlichen Verhältnissen entsprechendes Bild</div><div class="glossary-def">A picture corresponding to the actual circumstances — HGB's own corporation-specific formulation of "true and fair view" (§264(2)).</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="card cn">
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Kapitalflussrechnung</div><div class="glossary-def">Cash flow statement, mandatory for capital-market-oriented corporations under §264(1a).</div></div>
      <div class="glossary-item"><div class="glossary-term">Eigenkapitalspiegel</div><div class="glossary-def">Statement of changes in equity, also mandatory for capital-market-oriented corporations under §264(1a).</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

